<title>CANADA: TABLE- St Lawrence Q2 loss turns to profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE- St Lawrence Q2 loss turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			 1996</p>
<p> Shr  Profit	     C$0.38     Loss	C$0.14</p>
<p> Net  Profit	     16,864     Loss	 6,133</p>
<p> Revs		     195,324		  192,024</p>
<p>	   6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     Profit	  C$0.09     Loss	C$0.42</p>
<p> Net     Profit	   3,966     Loss	18,614</p>
<p> Revs		     270,505		  263,849</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Year earlier quarter net loss included C$19 million after-tax charge related to asset writeoffs and severance costs. The company said it expects continued improvements in its financial performance during the balance of 1997, mainly because of modest growth in all markets, especially in Ontario and the United States, and because of cost reductions and efficiency improvement initiatives.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
